    "Instrument ziehen = verschieben (0,5-mm-Raster) · Pfeiltasten = fein (Shift = 5 mm) · Ziehen daneben = schieben · Rad = Zoom": "Drag instrument = move (0.5 mm grid) · arrow keys = fine (Shift = 5 mm) · drag elsewhere = pan · wheel = zoom",
